    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow B - Agent Core (Slice 1: History + Knowledge Retrieval only)\n\nDeliberately minimal first slice per Rule 3: no write tools attached yet.\nCovers: fetch contact history -> build context -> agent reply, using only the Knowledge Retrieval tool.\n\nOnce this is verified working, the next slice adds Update HubSpot Property, Book Meeting, and Request Quote Draft — each with an internal needs_review guard, per the design decision already agreed.",
